    <briefdescription>
<para>Dense sequential type ID generator for efficient array indexing. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Assigns sequential IDs (0, 1, 2, ...) to types on first use. Thread-safe initialization, then lock-free reads. IDs are global - same type gets same ID across all <ref refid="classecss_1_1Registry" kindref="compound">Registry</ref> instances. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
